{"title": "Stone Camouflage", "pageid": 3962, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Stone_Camouflage", "categories": ["Racial features", "Passive features"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Stone_Camouflage.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4c/Stone_Camouflage.webp/300px-Stone_Camouflage.webp, /w/images/4/4c/Stone_Camouflage.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4c/Stone_Camouflage.webp/300px-Stone_Camouflage.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/4c/Stone_Camouflage.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Stone Camouflage</b> is a passive feature available to <a href=\"/wiki/Gnome#Deep_Gnome\" title=\"Gnome\">Deep Gnome</a> characters that grants them Advantage on Stealth checks.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>You have <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Advantage\" title=\"Advantage\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/28px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/42px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/55px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Advantage\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/28px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Advantage\" title=\"Advantage\">Advantage</a> on <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Stealth\" title=\"Stealth\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b9/Stealth_Icon.png/25px-Stealth_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b9/Stealth_Icon.png/38px-Stealth_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b9/Stealth_Icon.png/50px-Stealth_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Stealth\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b9/Stealth_Icon.png/25px-Stealth_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b9/Stealth_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Stealth\" title=\"Stealth\">Stealth</a> checks. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Races:\n\n</p>\n<ul><li>Character level 1: <a href=\"/wiki/Deep_Gnome\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Deep Gnome\">Deep Gnome</a></li></ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:85%;\">(<a href=\"/wiki/Character_level\" title=\"Character level\">Character level</a> is the sum of all class levels for a multi-classed character.)</span>\n</p>\n  <p>Used by creatures:</p><ul style=\"list-style-type: none\"><li><a href=\"/wiki/Barcus_Wroot\" title=\"Barcus Wroot\">Barcus Wroot</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Beldron\" title=\"Beldron\">Beldron</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Brounce\" title=\"Brounce\">Brounce</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Bumpnagel\" title=\"Bumpnagel\">Bumpnagel</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Dulbers_Frint\" title=\"Dulbers Frint\">Dulbers Frint</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Fuffi_Fuffers\" title=\"Fuffi Fuffers\">Fuffi Fuffers</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Fulguro\" title=\"Fulguro\">Fulguro</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Gipkins_Jared\" title=\"Gipkins Jared\">Gipkins Jared</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Hogi_Nuners\" title=\"Hogi Nuners\">Hogi Nuners</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Laridda\" title=\"Laridda\">Laridda</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Lunkbug\" title=\"Lunkbug\">Lunkbug</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Meerna\" title=\"Meerna\">Meerna</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Moorcombe\" title=\"Moorcombe\">Moorcombe</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Philomeen\" title=\"Philomeen\">Philomeen</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Skickpit\" title=\"Skickpit\">Skickpit</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Thulla\" title=\"Thulla\">Thulla</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Welso\" title=\"Welso\">Welso</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Wicky\" title=\"Wicky\">Wicky</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Wrint_Sprigley\" title=\"Wrint Sprigley\">Wrint Sprigley</a></li></ul>\n</div>    <div class=\"bg3wiki-preview-only\">\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Brief_preview\"> Brief preview </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">You have <a href=\"/wiki/Advantage\" title=\"Advantage\">Advantage</a> on <a href=\"/wiki/Stealth\" title=\"Stealth\">Stealth</a> checks.</div>\n</div> \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714202151\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.036 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.043 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 845/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 5538/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 2179/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 19/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 1201/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usage: 0.004/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 710788/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   36.945      1 Template:Passive_feature_page\n100.00%   36.945      1 -total\n 30.78%   11.371      2 Template:Icon_link\n 29.74%   10.989      2 Template:Icon_text\n 25.98%    9.600      4 Template:Trim\n 24.77%    9.150      1 Template:Advantage\n 18.94%    6.998      2 Template:Ifempty\n 18.78%    6.940      2 Template:Hidden_code\n 12.33%    4.554      1 Template:PageSeo\n 11.99%    4.429      1 Template:Passive_creatures_